@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Client calls the publication interface
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

actor Client
participant "PublicationCommand\nPublishRevisionHandler" as H
participant "ResourceAuthority" as A
participant "ResumeDraft" as D
participant "PublicationStore" as S
Client -> H : publish(validated explicit intent)
H -> A : require current scoped eligibility
A --> H : eligible context / denial
alt denied
 H --> Client : safe denied outcome
else initially eligible
 H -> D : snapshot(expected version)
 D --> H : snapshot / conflict
 alt stale version
  H --> Client : conflict; no publication
 else snapshot available
  H -> S : guarded commit(intent, snapshot)
  note right of S
   Establish relevant current authority/revocation order.
   Check expected version and repeated command identity.
   Coherently commit revision, live pointer and result.
  end note
  S --> H : actual committed / conflict / denied / failure outcome
  H --> Client : truthful bounded result
 end
end
note over Client,S
 Lost response after possible commit: resolve same command identity.
 No automatic resend, rendering, deployment or history mutation.
end note

@enduml
